<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Capistrano Unified SD, Calif..</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Capistrano Unified SD, Calif..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stone &amp; Youngberg LLC said it priced $12.5 million of Capistrano Unified School District, Calif., series 1997 special tax bonds, with a top yield of 7.10 percent in 2016.</p>
</text>
